  "description": "University of Kent International College (UK IC) is an embedded on-campus college designed for international students to start with their studies at University of Kent. The International College is in a dedicated building on the Canterbury campus, in the heart of student life and close to the on site student accommodation village. Oxford International (OIEG) operates UK IC in partnership with University of Kent. OIEG was founded in 1991 and is an accredited private education provider that operates international colleges, independent boarding schools, and English language centres across the UK and North America to create life-enhancing experiences for students worldwide. Timestamps Updated",
